<title>UK: EMI says no plans for U.S. listing.</title>
<headline>EMI says no plans for U.S. listing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMI Group Plc said on Tuesday it was not planning to seek a U.S. listing and would revert to the British practice of reporting results twice a year.</p>
<p>The company began quarterly financial reporting from the end of 1993, ahead of the demerger of Thorn Plc from Thorn EMI which went through in August 1996.</p>
<p>At that time Thorn EMI was considering a U.S. listing of its shares and Thorn did list its shares there on demerger.</p>
<p>However, EMI said it believed that there would be little benefit for its shareholders from such a listing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
